      "writtenOn": "2018-05-22T19:36:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "...But it\u0027s *not* reliable.  And making it so increases the risk of heisenbugs (that is, adding debugging changes the timing behavior you\u0027re trying to debug).\n\nA better fix is to have task-specific output buffers.  We\u0027ll need that for EC-3PO anyway, since output will be in packets which won\u0027t deal well with being interleaved.\n\nAs a compromise for now, I\u0027m ok putting it behind CONFIG_UART_TX_USES_CRITICAL_SECTION, and then only defining it when needed.  That\u0027ll solve your near-term problem on grunt.",
